GRGBanking HK Co., Ltd, a world leading self-service terminal and service provider, was founded in October, 2008 in Hongkong. Ranking top 3 in the world, GRGBanking HK provides more than 350,000 equipment for more than 110 countries and regions. GRGBanking HK has established oversea branches in USA,Germany, Turkey, Mexico, Singapore, Vietnam, Indonesia, Middle East region and some other countries and regions.

GRGBanking HK’s product portfolio includes financial self-service product, retail industry product, branch automation solution, cash sorting automation, OEM process module, and software solution. GRGBanking will accelerate business transformation innovatively base on new customer behavior while maintaining the sustainable income of traditional sector. As for service, GRGBanking HK has established a comprehensive overseas service network to provide global technical support, strengthening service localization according to actual development in each country.

Embracing the future, GRGBanking focuses on Fintech & Smart City with four artificial intelligence elements including data, algorithm, computing power, and scenario. The company devotes itself into the digitalization and intelligence of technological solutions for global market. While rapidly expanding artificial intelligence industry, the company builds intelligent applications and scenarios for customers in various fields, and commits to becoming a leading innovative solutions provider.

