WE ARE AN EQUAL OPPORTUNITIES EMPLOYER

Duties:
Analyze, design, develop, implement and test real-time, low-latency financial system and applications;

Research new technologies and third party frameworks;

Participate in user requirement collection;

Review and prepare technical documentations.

Requirements:
University Degree in Computer Science, Information Technology, Electronic Engineering or equivalent;

2 - 5 years or above relevant experience;

Strong programming knowledge in Java;

Good understanding of network programming is a plus;

Knowledge in HTML5, CSS, JavaScript;

Experience in React/Vue.js or other modern web frameworks would be an advantage;

Willing to learn and good team player;

Good communication skills in English and Chinese;

Self-motivated, work independently, good analytical and problem solving skill.

We Offer:
5-day work week

Annual Leave starting from 15 days per year

Medical Insurance

Life Insurance

