Company Overview:
Hong Kong RFID Ltd is a 20-year pioneer in RFID solutions, bringing proven expertise to apply RFID and IoT technology in the most impactful way possible. With 200+ projects and 5M+ assets tracked across construction and engineering sectors, we work on iconic Hong Kong construction projects with top-tier firms. We're aggressive, striving and ambitious for long-term success, and we're looking for individuals who take ownership, delegate effectively, and ensure client satisfaction.

