Key responsibilities of the incumbent are listed below:
Full Project Lifecycle Management:

To support sales team in pre-sale stage and tendering process with technical expertise;
To manage and configure (system customization) all BCDS (Building Components Database System) and BCMS (Building Components Management System) projects from inception to delivery;
To take complete ownership and responsibility for project success;
To delegate tasks effectively and coordinate with internal teams, vendors, and clients;
To ensure client satisfaction through proactive issue identification and resolution;
To monitor project progress, manage schedules, and deliver on commitments;
Client & Stakeholder Management:

To serve as the primary point of contact for clients throughout the project lifecycle;
