To translate technical requirements into practical solutions that meet client needs;
To manage client expectations and maintain strong relationships;
Technical Coordination:

To prepare technical specifications, system documentation, and tender proposals;
To evaluate technical specifications of new devices and solutions;
To coordinate between technical teams and non-technical stakeholders;
To ensure solutions are applied in the most impactful way for each project;
Requirements:
Individuals who meet the following requirements or possess equivalent combination of competence and experience are invited to apply:

Strong sense of ownership—you take responsibility for project outcomes and client satisfaction;
Excellent delegation skills—you can coordinate teams and resources effectively;
Self-managed problem solver who identifies issues early and resolves them proactively;
Fast learner who can quickly understand technical systems and client requirements;
Good technical understanding—you don't need to write code, but must understand tech stacks and explain them clearly to clients;
Strong communication skills for client-facing roles and technical presentations;
Comfortable using AI agents to accelerate project configuration and documentation;
Interest in RFID, IoT, or construction/engineering technology;
Willingness to adapt working hours to project needs (good project management = better work-life balance);
We don't care about your certifications or degrees—we care about your ability to take ownership, manage projects, delegate effectively, and solve real problems;
Experience in project management, system configuration, or technical sales is advantageous but not required;
Good command of written and spoken Chinese and English.
Career Progression:
We welcome candidates from entry level to management level. Your growth will be based on your ability to take ownership, deliver projects successfully, and satisfy clients.

